<title>USA: Voice Powered, Voice It continue talks.</title>
<headline>Voice Powered, Voice It continue talks.</headline>
<dateline>SHERMAN OAKS, Calif. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voice Powered Technology International Inc and Voice It Worldwide Inc said Wednesday they were continuing their negotiations but had agreed to terminate a letter of intent to merge.</p>
<p>The letter was announced December 19, 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement, the companies said certain conditions to the proposed stock-swap merger had not been met.</p>
<p>&quot;While there can be no assurance that a business combination can be successfully completed, the companies are continuing with discussions and negotiations,&quot; they said.</p>
</text>
